{"text":"MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "The ring connector assortment caught my interest because it offers small fastening hardware in several sizes, similar to the washer and metric screw assortments I recently explored.",
    "That match was tentative: I would only choose the connectors once I had a wiring job and knew which sizes I needed."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "Cutting wheels, wire brushes and a feeler gauge serve specific tasks I have not shown a need for; browsing fasteners does not mean I have a cutting, cleaning or precision-measuring project.",
    "Glue, epoxy and sealing tape do not follow my recent interest in hooks and mechanical fasteners, and the large glue pack exceeds my current needs.",
    "Pocket-hole screws are fastening hardware, but they serve woodworking rather than the metric machine-fastener needs reflected in my recent browsing.",
    "The COVID test and reaching aid do not connect to the hardware interests shown in my recent interactions."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "The recommendations seem to treat workshop supplies as interchangeable, even though each requires a different job to make it useful to me.",
    "Assortment packs and multipacks seem to count as a match without enough attention to whether I need their contents or quantities."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "My recent browsing repeatedly involved magnetic hooks, washers and metric nuts and bolts, which points more specifically toward hanging and mechanical fastening.",
    "I rarely interact unless something is relevant to a current need; a vaguely useful workshop item is not enough to make me choose it.",
    "The intended use and required sizes matter more to me than a shared resemblance to small hardware."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "The recommendations recognized a broad hardware interest but missed my narrower focus on hooks and mechanical fasteners suited to an actual task."
}"}
